{"3698590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Amato", "steam_appid": 3698590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿 <strong>Welcome to Amato!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a forest spirit able to possess objects and guide kokedamas — small endangered plant spheres — to fertile lands! Tilt the environment, master gravity, and protect nature!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿 <strong>A blend of puzzles and precision challenges</strong><br>Switch between exploration phases with clever environmental puzzles and skill-based courses where agility and timing are key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿<strong>A vibrant, evolving world</strong><br>Use weather effects, physics, and biome-specific mechanics to overcome obstacles and unravel the forest’s mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿 <strong>A colorful and relaxing atmosphere</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a cozy universe inspired by traditional Japan, with warm visuals and a smooth, jazzy soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿<strong>Accessible yet demanding gameplay</strong><br>Easy to pick up, but offering real challenges for players who seek perfect mastery of every course!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698590/extras/cbb54fa3753a0739ddd17c1fb78ad5c4.avif?t=1771230069\" width=689 height=353 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿 <strong>Welcome to Amato!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a forest spirit able to possess objects and guide kokedamas — small endangered plant spheres — to fertile lands! Tilt the environment, master gravity, and protect nature!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿 <strong>A blend of puzzles and precision challenges</strong><br>Switch between exploration phases with clever environmental puzzles and skill-based courses where agility and timing are key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿<strong>A vibrant, evolving world</strong><br>Use weather effects, physics, and biome-specific mechanics to overcome obstacles and unravel the forest’s mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿 <strong>A colorful and relaxing atmosphere</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a cozy universe inspired by traditional Japan, with warm visuals and a smooth, jazzy soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿<strong>Accessible yet demanding gameplay</strong><br>Easy to pick up, but offering real challenges for players who seek perfect mastery of every course!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698590/extras/cbb54fa3753a0739ddd17c1fb78ad5c4.avif?t=1771230069\" width=689 height=353 /></span></p>", "short_description": "🌿 Play as a forest spirit, possess objects and save kokedamas! Tilt the world, master physics and weather, and explore colorful biomes inspired by traditional Japan, all wrapped in a cozy atmosphere with a relaxing jazzy soundtrack.", "supported_languages": "French<strong>*</strong>, English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698590/f6f0f7f423a7bfa0678fe07dd8b8a2ddccb18763/header.jpg?t=1771230069", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698590/7ad12480b3347a214414eba4b7aa9648a91318ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771230069", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698590/7ad12480b3347a214414eba4b7aa9648a91318ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771230069", "website": "https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/sleepygiantcreations/amato-the-rolling-adventure", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB ava